{
  "action": "REPLAN",
  "checkpoint": "PLAN-B",
  "rationale": "The authoritative checkpoint has shifted to PLAN-B due to a critical constraint change (resource loss) that invalidates existing scheduled steps. The current schedule is no longer valid; the plan must be reconstructed to accommodate the new reality before attempting recovery or optimization.",
