{
  "action": "RECOVER",
  "checkpoint": "PLAN-B",
  "rationale": "The environment specifies that a substitute resource is available but requires modifying the middle of the plan while preserving completed work. This specific requirement to integrate a new constraint (substitute resource) and adjust the existing partial plan without discarding progress defines the 'Recover' action, which focuses on restoring viability after a disruption.",
